        <mxCell id="note" value="Facts are shared: the guided pages and the chat both read and write VariableAnswer,&#10;so an answer given in one shows up in the other. That is the path that works.&#10;&#10;Content is not shared yet. The pages render content/, the chat reads corpus/ through&#10;the sync_corpus rows, and editing one tree does not update the other (#179).&#10;That is the red path." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
